# Shell scripts must always check out with LF line endings, regardless of a
# platform's core.autocrlf setting - a CRLF-mangled shebang/script silently
# breaks under bash (Git Bash on Windows included, confirmed relevant here:
# this repo's own git config has core.autocrlf=true). See
# docs/explicativos/plan-almacenamiento.md Fase D, which is what first
# added tracked .sh files (scripts/neo4j_backup.sh, scripts/neo4j_restore.sh)
# to this repo.
*.sh text eol=lf
